  "CharacterDescription": "A bastard of the Vale carrying the surname Stone. He exists in the complicated space of being acknowledged enough to have a position but illegitimate enough to be denied full inheritance. The Vale's mountains and its knights are hardening influences, and bastards in the Vale are shaped by the same environment as the trueborn. He is capable and has made capability his defining characteristic by necessity.",
